WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.378
Over the holidays your child stops reading English, and the

00:00:03.378 --> 00:00:05.225
first weeks back at school are hard.

00:00:06.242 --> 00:00:09.667
Four weeks, four original stories, ten minutes a day.

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:14.745
It's for families with children aged 4 to 10 at Levels 1 to 2.

00:00:15.746 --> 00:00:18.433
149,000 dong one-time.

00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:21.533
See the sample, or message Mr. Jay on Zalo.

